== the settings the menu offers, and the one it deliberately does not ==
  theme-system    ● Follow the desktop
  theme-dark      ○ Dark
  --
  text-bigger     Bigger editor text
  text-smaller    Smaller editor text
  text-reset      Reset editor text size
  --
  show-whitespace ○ Show invisible characters
  --
  restore-session ● Reopen last session on start
  recent_limit is offered: false
== choosing a theme ==
  set dark    -> theme-set   theme: dark
      in force: dark   menu: ● Dark
  set dark    -> theme-same  the theme is already dark
      in force: dark   menu: ● Dark
  set system  -> theme-set   theme: system
      in force: system   menu: ● Follow the desktop
== a theme nobody defined is refused, and changes nothing ==
  bad-theme: no such theme: solarized
  still in force: system
== a hand-edited file with rubbish in it READS as system ==
  <> reads as system
  <DARK> reads as system
  <nonsense> reads as system
  <light> reads as system
== and what the editor and the tint do with each of the two ==
  system  dark=false editor=light
  dark    dark=true  editor=dark
== print is a FIGURE theme: not on the menu, honoured from the file, gray ==
  the menu's route: bad-theme
  <print> reads as print   editor=light   dark=false
  editor built: light (theme not probed)
  editor built: light (probe refused it)
  editor built: gBASIC Studio Print (probe took it)
  and under dark, probed: dark
  sheet is the print one: true   not the dark one: true
  system sets no sheet: true
  gray: bg, base, ctl, hi, fg, faint, line, sel, on_sel
== the editor's text size ==
  starts at 100%   a 10pt editor is 10pt
  bigger -> zoom-set   editor text: 115%
  bigger -> zoom-set   editor text: 130%
  bigger -> zoom-set   editor text: 150%
  smaller -> zoom-set  editor text: 130%
  smaller -> zoom-set  editor text: 115%
  reset   -> zoom-set   editor text: 100%
  again   -> zoom-same  the editor text is already 100%
== and it stops at both ends rather than running off ==
  top:    200%  the editor text is as far as it goes — 200%
  bottom: 80%  the editor text is as far as it goes — 80%
== a hand-edited size is SNAPPED to the ladder, never used raw ==
  1.07   reads as 100%
  47     reads as 200%
  -3     reads as 80%
  0.5    reads as 80%
  "big"  reads as 100%
== reopening the last session ==
  starts as: true   menu: ● Reopen last session on start
  toggled -> restore-off   Studio will start with nothing open — this takes effect on the next launch
      menu: ○ Reopen last session on start
  toggled -> restore-on    the last session will reopen on start
      menu: ● Reopen last session on start
== invisible characters ==
  starts as: false   menu: ○ Show invisible characters
  toggled -> whitespace-on   showing spaces, tabs and line ends
      menu: ● Show invisible characters
  toggled -> whitespace-off  invisible characters hidden
      menu: ○ Show invisible characters
  yes  reads as false
  1    reads as false
== both survive a save and a reload ==
  written: settings, session
  theme after reload:   dark
  restore after reload: false
  zoom after reload:    115%
  invisibles after reload: true
